"text": "This outfit brings your festive dinner look to life with a sophisticated warmth that fits the frosted air and the celebratory mood. The deep brown dress sets a rich, elegant base, while the gold necklace catches the light beautifully without overpowering the moment. You can easily balance the warm tones of the coat and bag with your dark grey scarf and green boots, letting the neutral backdrop highlight your features. Through the evening, you'll feel wrapped in comfort yet always polished, perfect for dining and dancing.",
"how_to_wear": [
"Wear the gold necklace close to your neck to let its warmth echo your skin and draw attention to your face as you toast with friends.",
"Tuck the waist-belted dress into itself or leave it open at the top depending on how much warmth you need, then pull the coat collar up against the frost when stepping outside.",
"Wrap the scarf loosely around your neck for easy removal if you get warm inside, or twist it once for a sharper line that complements the defined waist of your figure."
],
